# Keep the build context tiny and reproducible.
# NOTE: apps/web/package.json must stay in the context — `npm ci -w` resolves
# the whole workspace tree, so the manifest has to exist even though no web
# source does. Hence these targeted ignores instead of a blanket apps/web.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.gitignore
apps/web/src
apps/web/dist
apps/web/index.html
dist
**/dist
apps/server/data
.tmp-deploytest
*.log
.DS_Store
e2e-*.png
vercel.json
fly.toml
railway.toml
